MODIFICATIONS (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))

Third-party sources are modified during the build of this image, at build time
by the Dockerfile in this repository. The modified sources themselves are not
redistributed — only the resulting binaries are.

  * OpenSSL is patched with the BTLS patch shipped by bee2evp
    (btls/patch/<openssl-tag>.patch), which adds the STB 34.101.65
    ciphersuites to libssl. That patch is authored and distributed by the
    bee2evp project, not by us; we only apply it.

  * bee2evp's scripts/source.sh is patched to fix a numeric-versus-string
    comparison (`-eq` where `==` was meant) that otherwise forces every
    OpenSSL build into --debug, i.e. -O0. See the comment at that RUN step in
    the Dockerfile.

No other third-party source file is modified.
